sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant W as Next.js browser
  participant A as FastAPI
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  U->>W: username/password
  W->>A: POST /api/v1/users/login
  A->>D: lookup username/hash
  D-->>A: account row
  A->>A: Argon2 verify; sign HS256 JWT
  A-->>W: bearer token + expires_in
  W->>W: sessionStorage token
  W->>A: protected request + Bearer JWT
  A->>A: verify signature/claims/expiry
  A->>D: resolve sub UUID and active status
  D-->>A: user row
  A-->>W: owner-authorized response
